OL,3,GNEWSASummer wildfires caused
OL,4,A'catastrophic' hidden damage,
OL,5,Ascientists warn
OL,6,
OL,7,FScientists investigating the damage
OL,8,Fcaused by severe wildfires across Wales
OL,9,Fthis summer say the impact has been
OL,10,F"catastrophic".
OL,12,FExtreme heat and exceptionally dry
OL,13,Fconditions throughout July and August
OL,14,Fleft landscapes such as heathland,
OL,15,Fmoorland and upland grasslands
OL,16,Fvulnerable to fast spreading fires,
OL,17,Fresulting in one of the UK's worst
OL,18,Fwildfire seasons in recent years.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
