OL,3,GNEWSASummer wildfires caused
OL,4,A'catastrophic' hidden damage,
OL,5,Ascientists warn
OL,6,
OL,7,FProfessor Davey Jones, who is leading a
OL,8,FBangor University survey of several
OL,9,Fsites across Wales, said the scale of
OL,10,Fdamage was far greater than what was
OL,11,Fimmediately visible.
OL,13,F"People see the blackened vegetation
OL,14,Fand assume that's the main impact, but
OL,15,Fthe real story is below our feet," said
OL,16,FJones.
